# The PC state (module/pc_state_sim.c): on battery idle 30 s after a key, as before; plugged in
# without the app lit 10 minutes after the last key (#609 decision 2); bad D7 11 requests change
# nothing; the app's awake with the wake lights it at once and holds it past ZMK's 30 s; the
# keyboard asks a minute before the lease ends and the app renews it; away idles it at once,
# within 30 s of a key too; back wakes it at once (#604); a key ends away; with the app gone
# the lease lapses (both asks unanswered) and the USB idle time from the last key applies; an
# unplug ends the hold at once; as the right (decision 3) the hold needs its own USB power and
# shows the left's own on/off, away and awake from the left follow at once; the left hands the
# right its keys' activity and on/off, never the hold; on battery ZMK's 30-minute sleep is
# unchanged.
/^pcstate: /p
/^SIM_SLEEP$/p
